    <li><strong>Correction rounds:</strong> Round 1 included at no extra charge. From Round 2 onwards, fees apply as agreed in advance.</li>
    <li><strong>Delivery:</strong> Within 14 working days from written correction approval. Fridays, Saturdays & public holidays excluded.</li>
    <li><strong>Approval required:</strong> All correction specs must be confirmed in writing before production resumes.</li>
    <li><strong>Original invoice:</strong> This correction references PI ${orig||'—'}. Original payment terms remain in effect.</li>
  </ol>
</div>
<div class="ifooter">
  <div class="ifl"><strong>SDF Clothing</strong><br>House 125, Road 01, Baridhara DOSH, Dhaka-1212<br>contact@sdfltd.com</div>
  <div class="ifr">Electronically generated invoice. No physical signature required. PI <strong>${pi}</strong> is the unique reference for this correction round.</div>
</div>`;

  document.getElementById('c-pdf-title').textContent = `Invoice ${pi}`;
